div.p:
—taken innumerable diplomatic initiatives expressing concern over general
                    conditions or specific offenses and encouraging specific improvements (prisoner
                    releases, elections, etc.);

note.p:
The list of countries for whom assistance has been reviewed at the policy level (there is a working group that reviews
                        every loan) includes: Argentina; Benin;
                    Bolivia; Botswana; Brazil; Cameroon; Central African Empire; Chile; Costa Rica;
                    Ethiopia; Guatemala; Guinea; Haiti; Honduras; Indonesia; Jamaica; Kenya; Korea;
                    Laos; Lesotho; Liberia; Malaysia; Malawi; Mali; Mauritania; Mexico; Nicaragua;
                    Niger; Paraguay; Peru; Philippines; Romania; Rwanda; Senegal; Sudan; Tanzania;
                    Togo; Upper Volta; Uruguay; Zaire. [Footnote in the original.]
